✅ Start it
docker compose up -d

✅ Create first admin user
sudo docker compose exec passbolt su -m -c "/usr/share/php/passbolt/bin/cake \
  passbolt register_user \
  -u admin@example.com \
  -f admin \
  -l admin \
  -r admin" -s /bin/sh www-data

✅ Browse the setup URL

It will output something like:

https://passbolt.local/setup/install/UUID/UUID


Follow the onboarding wizard.